-- args
format --stdin-file-path input.md --wrap 80
-- stdin
Use `events.jsonl`, cite [^2], then stop.

`ir` creates the environment with `reticulate`'s uv-backed environment
helper, sets `RETICULATE_PYTHON`, and activates the environment for
subprocesses. Declare `reticulate` under `packages` when the R script
loads `reticulate`.
-- stdout
Use `events.jsonl`, cite [^2], then stop.

`ir` creates the environment with `reticulate`'s uv-backed environment helper,
sets `RETICULATE_PYTHON`, and activates the environment for subprocesses.
Declare `reticulate` under `packages` when the R script loads `reticulate`.
